{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16584","headline":"望终南春雪 · 李子卿","name":"望终南春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山势抱西秦，初年瑞雪频。\n色摇鹑野霁，影落凤城春。\n辉燿银峰逼，晶明玉树亲。\n尚寒由气劲，不夜爲光新。\n荆岫全疑近，崑丘宛合邻。\n余辉傥可借，回照读书人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李子卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}